0..78 Comment "// Each declaration here is a point where the port of Ahman and Bauer\'s oracle"
79..96 Comment "// sheaves stops."
97..99 Comment "//"
100..177 Comment "// The record of the port names the first definition that gandr cannot state."
178..243 Comment "// A stop that one declaration shows is refused here by its code."
244..246 Comment "//"
247..323 Comment "// gandr postulates no axiom, declines truncation and path constructors, and"
324..404 Comment "// takes no level as a parameter. No lambda into types fills a modality\'s family"
405..477 Comment "// under binders. A cell over a continuation presents no sheaf equation."
478..480 Comment "//"
481..496 Comment "// - see: #4728"
497..574 Comment "// - see: `../../model/effects/oracle-sheaves.gandr` — the parts that check"
